{
    "title": "Kung Fu Tea",
    "description": "Welcome to America\u2019s Bubble Tea - Kung Fu Tea Mobile app. Do you live and breathe Kung Fu Tea? Do you crave boba all the time, no matter where you are? With the Kung Fu Tea Mobile app, you can place an order anywhere. Just choose pick up or delivery and get your favorite tea while earning rewards!\r\n\r\nEnjoy mobile ordering and earn free boba!\r\n\r\n- ORDER AHEAD: Need a quick boba fix? Skip the lines. Skip the wait. Order ahead and pick up in-store.\r\n \r\n- ORDER DELIVERY: Get Kung Fu Tea delivered to you anywhere and earn rewards!\r\n \r\n- REAL-TIME ORDER TRACKING: Track your contactless delivery order in real time, from the store to your door.\r\n \r\n- CUSTOMIZED MENU - We\u2019ll remember what drink you like, your favorite toppings and how you like it (sugar level, ice level) for fast re-ordering.\r\n \r\n- BUILT-IN REWARDS: Get 2 bubbles for every $1 spent! You\u2019ll unlock free drinks on your birthday**,  first sign-up* and for every 168 bubbles earned.\r\n\r\n- EXCLUSIVE DEALS&REWARDS: Enjoy our exclusive app promos and win instant in-app prizes!\r\n \r\n- DIGITAL GIFT CARDS: Easily send Kung Fu Tea e-gift cards to your friends and family.\r\n \r\n- REFERRAL CREDIT: Refer a friend, get app credit for your next purchase.\r\n \r\n- PROMO CODES: Unique promo codes to redeem customer rewards.\r\n \r\n- STORE LOCATOR: Find Kung Fu Tea locations nearby.\r\n \r\n*One (1) Free standard on signup available for new app users.\r\n**Must be Red Belt status to be eligible for a free birthday drink (up to $6).\r\n \r\nTalk about a win! Download today!\r\n \r\nQuestions or comments? Contact us at https://www.kungfutea.com/contactus",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to America\u2019s Bubble Tea - Kung Fu Tea Mobile app. Do you live and breathe Kung Fu Tea? Do you crave boba all the time, no matter where you are? With the Kung Fu Tea Mobile app, you can place an order anywhere. Just choose pick up or delivery and get your favorite tea while earning rewards!<br><br>Enjoy mobile ordering and earn free boba!<br><br>- ORDER AHEAD: Need a quick boba fix? Skip the lines. Skip the wait. Order ahead and pick up in-store.<br> <br>- ORDER DELIVERY: Get Kung Fu Tea delivered to you anywhere and earn rewards!<br> <br>- REAL-TIME ORDER TRACKING: Track your contactless delivery order in real time, from the store to your door.<br> <br>- CUSTOMIZED MENU - We\u2019ll remember what drink you like, your favorite toppings and how you like it (sugar level, ice level) for fast re-ordering.<br> <br>- BUILT-IN REWARDS: Get 2 bubbles for every $1 spent! You\u2019ll unlock free drinks on your birthday**,  first sign-up* and for every 168 bubbles earned.<br><br>- EXCLUSIVE DEALS&amp;REWARDS: Enjoy our exclusive app promos and win instant in-app prizes!<br> <br>- DIGITAL GIFT CARDS: Easily send Kung Fu Tea e-gift cards to your friends and family.<br> <br>- REFERRAL CREDIT: Refer a friend, get app credit for your next purchase.<br> <br>- PROMO CODES: Unique promo codes to redeem customer rewards.<br> <br>- STORE LOCATOR: Find Kung Fu Tea locations nearby.<br> <br>*One (1) Free standard on signup available for new app users.<br>**Must be Red Belt status to be eligible for a free birthday drink (up to $6).<br> <br>Talk about a win! Download today!<br> <br>Questions or comments? Contact us at https://www.kungfutea.com/contactus",
